{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想讓孩子在遊戲中自然練習數學？Math Racing 2 Pro 是一款 3D 賽車遊戲，每答對一道數學題就能取得加速，把加減乘除、百分比、四捨五入、單雙數等練習融入賽車節奏之中，適閤家長與學生使用。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>答對題目即可加速</h2>\n<p>遊戲提供加法、減法、乘法、除法、位值、百分比、四捨五入、大於小於、跳數及單雙數等題目類型，另設隨機題目與漸進難度選項，可按程度調整。內含 13 款車輛、5 條賽道、成就係統與三種玩法，並以街機賽車風格配合圖像、音效與音樂，全程沒有廣告，屬通用 App。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2688x1242bb-5-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2688x1242bb-6-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2688x1242bb-7-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2688x1242bb-8-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2688x1242bb-9-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2688x1242bb-10-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Math Racing 2 Pro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T22:59:16.760523+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}